dentify the pick-up location while the driver remained at departures, so the mislocation is not attributable to pin ambiguity. The rider is also exonerated on POL-NS-04: the rider sent a locating message, the driver neither replied within 120 s nor placed an in-app call, and the rider's device stayed within 17.14 m of the pin across 55 of 55 qualifying fixes, inside the 200 m AIRPORT rider-presence radius. On weight (POL-GEN-02): every artifact carrying a deciding fact — the GPS trace and the trip record — is at weight 1.0, so confidence is not capped below that, and no POL-NS-08 limb (clock skew, trace gap, chat truncation, fare mismatch) is engaged. The fare line reconciles: SGD 8.00 is the GREATER of the SGD 6.00 AIRPORT zone-class fee and the SGD 8.00 RYDE_XL vehicle-tier fee, so there is no POL-NS-08(d) defect. The traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-00616-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0; it is cited only for its absence and carries no fact, so it neither lowers confidence nor makes POL-NS-06(i) accumulation available. Amounts used: contested cancellation fee SGD 8.00; refund to the rider SGD 8.00; driver compensation none."
